[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:0.1"], "en": "The Therāpadāna,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:0.2"], "en": "Kaccāyanavagga 7:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:0.3"], "en": "The Apadāna of the Elder Mahākoṭṭhika", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:1.1"], "en": "“The Victor named Padumuttara,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:1.2"], "en": "the Sage who knows all the world,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:1.3"], "en": "[appeared] one hundred thousand aeons from now.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:1.4"], "en": "In that eon, the Visionary One appeared.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:2.1"], "en": "He was the instructor, the enlightener,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:2.2"], "en": "and the deliverer of all living beings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:2.3"], "en": "The Buddha, skilled in teaching,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:2.4"], "en": "has delivered many people;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:3.1"], "en": "he is compassionate and merciful.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:3.2"], "en": "Seeking the welfare of all living beings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:3.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:3.4"], "en": "he established all the visiting followers of other sects in the five precepts.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:4.1", "PA_tha-ap_539:4.2"], "en": "Thus it was free from confusion and empty of non-Buddhist sectarians,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:4.3"], "en": "yet variegated with Arahants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:4.4"], "en": "By those who have attained mastery and are poised in equanimity.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:5.1", "PA_tha-ap_539:5.2"], "en": "That Great Sage has arisen, possessing the eighty-four thousand teachings as his jewels.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:5.3"], "en": "Resembling a priceless golden ornament,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:5.4"], "en": "endowed with the thirty-two excellent marks,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:6.1"], "en": "for one hundred thousand years,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:6.2"], "en": "As long as life still remained,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:6.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:6.4"], "en": "for that long he stayed and delivered many people.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:7.1"], "en": "At that time, in Haṃsavatī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:7.2"], "en": "I was a brahmin who had mastered the Vedas;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:7.3"], "en": "having approached the Supreme One in all the world, I...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:7.4"], "en": "I heard the teaching of the Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:8.1", "PA_tha-ap_539:8.2"], "en": "Then that Hero, whose range of intelligence was fully developed, addressed a disciple:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:8.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:8.4", "PA_tha-ap_539:9.1"], "en": "He established as foremost among those skilled in the meanings, the Dhamma, the terminology, and the inspired eloquence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:9.2"], "en": "Having heard that, I was delighted;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:9.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:9.4"], "en": "I then fed the Supreme Victor together with his disciples for seven days.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:10.1"], "en": "Having covered Duṣṭaśas with his own cloak,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:10.2", "PA_tha-ap_539:10.3"], "en": "he prostrated at the feet of the ocean of wisdom together with his disciple.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:10.4", "PA_tha-ap_539:11.1"], "en": "I aspired for that state. Then the Foremost One in the World said:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:11.2"], "en": "“Behold this supreme among birds!”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:11.3"], "en": "It was bent at the foot of me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:11.4", "PA_tha-ap_539:12.1"], "en": "the most excellent Buddha, that monk who possesses a radiance like the interior of a lotus.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:12.2", "PA_tha-ap_539:12.3"], "en": "This person aspires to a [higher] state through that faith, generosity,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:12.4"], "en": "and hearing of the true Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:13.1"], "en": "Having been happy in every place,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:13.2"], "en": "wandering through existence after existence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:13.3"], "en": "in a future time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:13.4"], "en": "You shall attain that heart’s desire.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:14.1"], "en": "In a hundred thousand aeons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:14.2"], "en": "born into the lineage of Okkāka;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:14.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:14.4"], "en": "One named Gotama by clan will become a teacher in the world;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:15.1"], "en": "he shall be an heir to his teachings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:15.2"], "en": "Born from the heart, fashioned by the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:15.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:15.4"], "en": "he shall be a disciple of the Teacher known by the name Koṭṭhika.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:16.1"], "en": "Having heard that, being delighted,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:16.2", "PA_tha-ap_539:16.3"], "en": "I then served the Jina for as long as I lived with a mind of loving-kindness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:16.4"], "en": "Mindful, possessed of wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:17.1", "PA_tha-ap_539:17.2"], "en": "and concentrated. By that karmic ripening and by his volitions and aspirations;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:17.3"], "en": "Having abandoned my human body,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:17.4"], "en": "I went to the realm of the Thirty-three;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:18.1"], "en": "three hundred times indeed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:18.2"], "en": "I exercised sovereignty over the gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:18.3"], "en": "and five hundred times,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:18.4"], "en": "I was a wheel-turning monarch.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:19.1"], "en": "I enjoyed extensive regional sovereignty,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:19.2"], "en": "beyond all counting;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:19.3"], "en": "I was happy in every respect.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:19.4"], "en": "By the force of that karma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:20.1"], "en": "I transmigrate through two states of existence:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:20.2"], "en": "among the gods and among humans.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:20.3"], "en": "I do not go to another destination;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:20.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of well-performed deeds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:21.1"], "en": "I am reborn in two families:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:21.2"], "en": "Neither among the Khattiyas nor the Brāhmaṇas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:21.3"], "en": "nor in a low-born family am I born;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:21.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of well-performed deeds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:22.1"], "en": "When my final existence was reached,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:22.2", "PA_tha-ap_539:22.3"], "en": "I became a kinsman of Brahmā in a brahmin family in Sāvatthī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:22.4"], "en": "I was reborn into great wealth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:23.1"], "en": "My mother’s name was Candavatī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:23.2"], "en": "and my father was Assalāyana.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:23.3", "PA_tha-ap_539:23.4"], "en": "When the Buddha disciplined my father through complete purification,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:24.1"], "en": "I then became confident in the Sugata.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:24.2"], "en": "I went forth into homelessness;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:24.3"], "en": "Moggallāna was my teacher,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:24.4"], "en": "and Sārisambhava was my preceptor.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:25.1"], "en": "While my hair was being cut,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:25.2"], "en": "the view with its roots was severed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:25.3"], "en": "and as I put on the saffron robe,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:25.4"], "en": "I attained arahantship.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:26.1", "PA_tha-ap_539:26.2"], "en": "My mind is intent upon the meanings, the teachings, the grammar, and inspired eloquence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:26.3"], "en": "The Chief of the World, having distinguished me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:26.4"], "en": "placed me in that foremost position;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:27.1"], "en": "I have explained what was not seen before.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:27.2"], "en": "Being questioned by Upatissa,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:27.3"], "en": "I declared: \"In the analytical knowledges,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:27.4"], "en": "I am the foremost in the teaching of the Buddha.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:28.1"], "en": "The defilements have been burnt away by me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:28.2"], "en": "...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:28.3"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:29.1"], "en": "Welcome indeed has come to me...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:29.2", "PA_tha-ap_539:29.3"], "en": "[and so on] ...the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:30.1", "PA_tha-ap_539:30.2"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:30.3"], "en": "[and so forth] ...the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:31.1"], "en": "Thus indeed the venerable elder Mahākoṭṭhika spoke these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_539:32.1"], "en": "This is the seventh legend of the elder Mahākoṭṭhika.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
]
